  },
  "description": {
    "text": "The French Pokémon Countdown Calendar for Christmas 2008, sold in France from November 2008. Behind each of its doors for the days of December was a card, and on the 25th a booster pack of Diamond & Pearl Great Encounters (Duels au sommet). Its 24 cards are Pikachu, the DP16 Black Star promo, and 23 reprints of Diamond & Pearl era cards that keep their set symbol and number and add a snowflake stamp to the picture."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A snowflake stamp on the picture"
  },
